"Sylvain is a persona of Syl the slime, run by her lead sub-core, Alpha."
"Sylvain's first Identify reading was faked by Syl's identity skills."
"Burt never existed; Syl made him up for Sylvain."
"Sylvain was never truly charmed; Syl only acted it to be carried into Azulean."
"In Azulean Sylvain freed the captive humans and teleported them to a Saltport inn."
"Sylvain's own classes came from levels Syl gave him: Mage, Sorcerer and one Elementalist level."
"Sylvain now lives as his own person with his own memories, though Syl can see through him."
"Vanessa bound herself to Sylvain with a siren's pearl, which he ate."
